# Runs before every commit.
#
# lint-staged only touches files that are actually staged, and it re-stages what
# it fixes — so formatting and auto-fixable lint problems are corrected in place
# rather than becoming a separate "fix lint" commit.
#
# Deliberately fast. Type checking and tests belong in pre-push, where a couple of
# seconds is fine; here they would tax every single commit.
npx lint-staged
